  Attempts to send this tidbit to nethack-bugs failed (has
it gone out of operation?), so I am posting it:

  I was looking through the monster-making code (pl9), and
noticed that in the "switch" for giving special stuff to
monsters when they are created, the code for elves has somehow
been placed in the S_HUMANOID case (i.e. monsters represented
by 'h') rather than the S_HUMAN case (monsters represented
by '@').  Therefore, as I have noticed in the game, elves never
carry the nice stuff (like elven mithril coats) which they
are entitled to.

  The fix is obvious.

	-- Bill Skaggs


